"""
ssrk_otsd_probe_01: creditors outstanding from the LIVE postings, hypothesis test on a sample. 300 DOCUMENT_CODEs (seeded random sample, seed 7) taken from the verified Creditors run
run_20261005_012 are looked up in SSRK.FINPOST by ENTCODE (indexed, composite with ENTTYPE). The question: is the outstanding cube's DOCUMENT_CODE = FINPOST.ENTCODE, and are its
AMOUNT / ADJUSTED / PENDING = FINPOST DAMOUNT - CAMOUNT / ADJAMT / the difference? Only the four creditor ledgers are read; no narration, cheque or party columns. The date predicate is the explicit
start of the data (2016), because open creditor items reach back to 2018 and the ENTCODE list is the real bound.
"""
